          ],
          "content": "(v) Shakila puts \\` 100 into her daughter’s money box when she was one year old and increased the amount by \\` 50 every year. The amounts of money (in \\`) in the box on the 1st, 2nd, 3rd, 4th, . . . birthday were 100, 150, 200, 250, . . ., respectively."
